        dcterms:description "Spans 6 Chick ontogenetic stages (E6-E16, L423-475), 12 developmental points across 3 vertebrate species (Chick, Quail, Mouse, L478-528), 5 FK506 and surgical smooth-muscle ablation conditions (FK506@E6, Surgical Slit@E10, FK506@E11, FK506@E14, WT@E16, L531-570), and exposes `--epsilon-x`, `--epsilon-y`, `--alpha3`, `--E-ratio-scale`, and `--seed` CLI overrides (L1145-1174)." ;
